## Government is a promise made on behalf of everyone and enforced against anyone. That's why it has to serve everyone. The 2026 midterms just handed that promise to a new majority. The question now is whether they'll keep it for the people who voted against them.

> **📜 The Faction Files: How Two Parties Took Over America**
